        weights, architecture, or any constituent components;

    (c) Distribute, sublicense, or share copies of the Model, in whole or
        in part, to any third party, provided that you include the original
        NOTICE and this License Agreement in its entirety;

    (d) Use the Model to train derivative models, and distribute such
        derivative models under any license of your choosing.

1.2 YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND AGREE THAT:

    (a) The Model is provided "AS IS" and "WITH ALL FAULTS" (including but not
        limited to cognitive faults, perceptual faults, and metaphysical faults);

